% array operators test file

/myarray 3 array def
myarray 1 4 put
myarray 0 3 put
myarray 2 5 put
myarray
pstack         %[3 4 5]
myarray 1 get
myarray 0 get
add =           %7
clear
[1 2 3]
{1 add} forall
pstack %2 3 4

clear
[1 2 3 4] 1 3 getinterval
(a b c) 1 2  getinterval

/a [1 2 3 4] def
